{
  "_readme": [
    "Input fixture for the pyfmt.Dumps parity tests. Each key except this one and",
    "'edge_cases' is a pydantic class name; its value is the constructor kwargs.",
    "go/scripts/gen_golden.py builds the model, calls model_dump(), and writes",
    "json.dumps(dump, indent=2) / json.dumps(dump) into testdata/golden/. The Go",
    "test unmarshals the SAME sub-object into the identically named Go struct and",
    "compares pyfmt.Dumps(v, 2) / pyfmt.DumpsCompact(v) byte for byte.",
    "Every field is supplied explicitly so the comparison exercises Dumps, not the",
    "two default-seeding implementations."
  ],
